<view class="page login-page"><view class="brand"><view class="mark">谋</view><view><view class="h1">深谋远虑</view><view class="muted">AI 营销智能决策平台</view></view></view><view class="card login-card"><view class="eyebrow">MOBILE ACCESS</view><view class="h2">手机号登录</view><view class="muted">登录后，你的决策记录与 SARSA 在线更新会关联到同一账号。</view><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入手机号" bindinput="onPhone"/><view class="code-row"><input class="input code-input" type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="验证码" bindinput="onCode"/><button class="code-btn" bindtap="sendCode" loading="{{sending}}" disabled="{{countdown>0}}">{{countdown>0?countdown+'s':'获取验证码'}}</button></view><button class="primary" bindtap="login" loading="{{loggingIn}}">登录并进入</button><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view><view class="muted foot">短信验证码由 CloudBase 身份认证发送。算法决策仍由后端 Deep SARSA 完成。</view></view>